"description": "Norconsult Holding AS engages in the owns and invests in shares and equities. It operates through the following business segments: Norway Head Office, Norway Regions, Renewable Energy, Sweden, Denmark, and Digital and Technogarden. The Norway Head Office involves the operations in the greater Oslo area and supports the entire group with expertise in the market areas of transport, buildings, industry, water, environment, architecture as well as society and urban development. The Norway Regions segment focuses on the operations in Norway outside the greater Oslo area. The Renewable Energy segment refers to the services for the renewable sector with locations in Norway, Poland, Iceland, Finland in addition to Africa, and Asia. The Sweden segment operates in Sweden except Swedish Digital and Technogarden operations. The Denmark segment deals with operations in Denmark. The Digital and Technogarden segment provides consultancy for the infrastructure and property sectors. The company was founded on November 13, 1991 and is headquartered in Sandvika, Norway.",
